f;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">일 자로 출석미달자 및 출석미달</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">주의</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">자 대상으로 금오톡톡 안내 메시지가 발송되었습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">수강 중인 교과목 중 결석시간이 전체 수업시간의&nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1/4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">을 초과하는 경우 출석미달로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">F</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><b>학점 처리예정과목</b>이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전체수업시간&nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1/4</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">50%</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">이상 결석하는 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전체 수업시간의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1/8</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><b>인 과목의 경우 출석미달 주의과목</b>입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">출석미달교과목현황은&nbsp;</span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">원스톱서비스&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">–&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학사관리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">수강신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">-</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">개인별강의시간표 조회 하단 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">교과목 현황</span>에서 조회가능합니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">** 유의사항 **</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전자출결에서 출결상황이 미입력 과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">미출결 상태</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">은 출석미달교과목 현황에서 조회되지 않아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">대상자에서 누락될 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;전자출결 앱에서 본인의 출결상황을 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- LMS&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">동영상 강의 및 실시간 온라인 강의의 출결정보는 반영시기가 유동적일 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">이에 따라 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">대상이 아님에도 안내메세지가 발송될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">- 조기취업자의 경우 출결 처리는 출석인정 승인여부는 학과 또는 교무처로 문의하여주시고, 승인완료된 과목의 출결 사항은 해당 과목 교수님께 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">출결에 오류가 있을 시 해당과목 교수님께&nbsp;문의하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">기타문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">교무과&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">478-7031</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">감사합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
